        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Evelyn Waugh\n- Works: Brideshead Revisited, Helena\n- Topics: English prose style, historical novels\n\nFacts:\n- Evelyn Waugh is recognised as one of the great prose stylists of the English language in the 20th century.\n- Evelyn Waugh published Brideshead Revisited, subtitled The Sacred & Profane Memories of Captain Charles Ryder, in 1945.\n- Brideshead Revisited is a novel by English writer Evelyn Waugh.\n- Evelyn Waugh published Helena in 1950.\n- Helena is Evelyn Waugh's only historical novel.",
